=== HINT 1 ===
switch case syntax:
  case 1:
      return "Monday";
  case 2:
      return "Tuesday";
  ...

=== HINT 2 ===
When you return inside a case you don't need a break statement.
Use 'default:' at the end to catch everything else.

=== HINT 3 (SPOILER) ===
case 1: return "Monday";
case 2: return "Tuesday";
case 3: return "Wednesday";
case 4: return "Thursday";
case 5: return "Friday";
case 6: return "Saturday";
case 7: return "Sunday";
default: return "unknown";
